{"id":2245,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2245"},"modified":"2025-10-02T14:56:02","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T14:56:02","slug":"cardboard-boxes-with-handle","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-handle\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Boxes With Handle"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Strong and Reliable Build for Heavy or Medium Products<\/h2>\n<p>Cardboard boxes with handle make transportation simpler, especially when packing bulky or medium-weight products. At Shop Cardboard Boxes, we offer custom <strong>cardboard box with handles<\/strong> in all sizes and styles. Whether you\u2019re sending out orders, creating packaging for retail, or preparing for an event, these handled boxes add convenience and structure to your packaging.<\/p>\n<p>Our boxes are made from durable corrugated or solid cardboard. They&#8217;re easy to lift, sturdy in build, and available with full-color custom printing. We offer <strong>cardboard boxes with handle wholesale<\/strong> with fast delivery, free design, and multiple finishing options.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"319\">Choose Packaging That\u2019s Made to Move<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"576\">Cardboard boxes with handles are a smart solution for packaging that\u2019s easy to carry and built to hold weight. Whether you&#8217;re packing promotional items, food deliveries, or personal belongings, these handled boxes provide ease and strength during transit.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"792\">Each box is designed to hold its shape without collapsing. Reinforced die-cut handles make lifting safer and more comfortable, especially when dealing with heavy or bulky contents. These boxes are commonly used in:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"964\">\n<li data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"828\">\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"828\">Gift or retail-ready packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"865\">\n<p data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"865\">Takeout meals or catering orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"900\">\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"900\">Event kits and marketing boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"932\">\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"932\">Product sampling or mailers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"964\">\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"964\">Temporary storage or moving<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1113\">We also provide <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1022\">cardboard boxes with handle and lids<\/strong> to offer more protection against dust and accidental spillage during shipping or handling.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1118\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1171\">Cardboard Boxes with Handle Wholesale Available<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1515\">If you&#8217;re sourcing <strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1233\">cardboard boxes with handle wholesale<\/strong>, we\u2019ve got flexible volume pricing and customization to support bulk orders. Available in a range of sizes and board strengths, these boxes work well for manufacturers, brands, and e-commerce businesses. Choose between Kraft, white, or printed surfaces with your logo or messaging.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1729\">We also support full-color CMYK printing, cut-out windows, and box lamination (matte or gloss). Optional features include internal dividers, custom inserts, and coating upgrades like Spot UV for brand highlights.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1734\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1779\">Add-on Packaging Options You Might Need<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"2165\">Looking for more ways to improve your box display or function? Combine these boxes with <strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1965\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-sleeve-packaging\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1963\">Cardboard Sleeve Packaging<\/a><\/strong> to offer tamper-evidence or extra visual branding on shelves. Cardboard sleeves slide over the box and act as an outer cover or branding wrap \u2014 often used in retail setups or when presenting samples.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2170\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2214\">Cardboard Boxes With Handle for Moving<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2531\">Relocating fragile or personal items? Our <strong data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2300\">cardboard boxes with handle for moving<\/strong> are preferred by moving professionals and storage companies. Built for strength, these boxes reduce strain during handling and minimize tearing. Available in both single-wall and double-wall corrugated board, they&#8217;re suitable for:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2638\">\n<li data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2561\">\n<p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2561\">Office files and folders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2592\">\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2592\">Kitchen items or glassware<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2616\">\n<p data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2616\">Clothing and linens<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2638\">\n<p data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2638\">Tools or hardware<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2841\">We also offer <strong data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2691\">large cardboard boxes with handle<\/strong> for packing bulky household items or warehouse goods. These options can come with lids, flaps, or interlocking tops depending on your handling needs.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2846\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2893\">Order Custom Boxes With Handle \u2013 Your Way<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"3028\">We manufacture handled cardboard boxes in custom dimensions, with short-run and bulk printing options. Our standard features include:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3257\">\n<li data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3074\">\n<p data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3074\">Corrugated or Kraft board from 10pt\u201328pt<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3103\">\n<p data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3103\">CMYK &amp; PMS color options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3144\">\n<p data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3144\">Matte, Gloss, or Soft-touch finishes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3190\">\n<p data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3190\">Die-cut handle styles and locking options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3257\">\n<p data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3257\">Add-ons like window cut-outs, inserts, and tear-strip closures<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3396\">We offer <strong data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3294\">free design assistance<\/strong>, quick production times, and low MOQs. You can choose to keep it plain or go for full-color branding.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Boxes With Handle Wholesale Sizes and Materials<\/h2>\n<h3>Popular Dimensions for Carry Boxes<\/h3>\n<p>Below are the commonly ordered sizes. We can also produce custom dimensions on request.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Dimensions (inches)<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Properties<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">6x4x4 to 9x6x6<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft Paper, White SBS (Solid Bleached Sulfate)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Lightweight, eco-friendly, food-safe<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Glossy Coating, Matte Finish, Spot UV Coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Die-cut handles, Window cut-outs, Ribbon holes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Party favors, Small takeaway items, Gift packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Medium<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">10x7x7 to 12x9x6<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated B-Flute<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Durable, shock-absorbent, recyclable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Soft-touch Lamination, UV Coating, Embossing\/Debossing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Snap-lock base, Reinforced corners, Tear strips<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Product kits, Retail packaging, Electronics boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Large<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">14x10x10 and larger<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Double-wall Cardboard<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Heavy-duty, high strength, moisture resistant<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matte Laminate, Anti-scratch coating, Water-resistant coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Foldable lid, Lock tab, Handles, Stackable design<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Moving boxes, Heavy or bulky items, Storage boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>These boxes are die-cut with side or top handles depending on your use.<\/p>\n<h3>Material Options for Durability and Weight Support<\/h3>\n<p>Our cardboard boxes come in various board grades based on your item weight. Some of the options include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>E-Flute and B-Flute corrugated board<\/li>\n<li>16pt to 28pt cardboard<\/li>\n<li>White SBS and Brown Kraft<\/li>\n<li>Eco-friendly and recycled board<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>All materials can be printed, scored, and finished with high precision.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Full Customization for Branding and Finish<\/h2>\n<h3>Printing and Logo Options for Handled Boxes<\/h3>\n<p>Our handled boxes can be fully printed with your branding, colors, or artwork. You can also add product info, barcodes, or QR codes to increase engagement.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Printing<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Color options: CMYK (full color), PMS (spot colors), or no print<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Kraft paper (natural brown, eco-friendly)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Matte finish (non-reflective, smooth)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Logo cut-outs (custom shapes for branding visibility)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Shipping boxes with handles for easy carrying and branding<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; High-resolution print quality<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Whiteboard (smooth, bright white surface)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Gloss finish (shiny, vibrant colors)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; QR codes for customer engagement and tracking<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Retail packaging to enhance shelf appeal<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Double-sided or single-sided printing options<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Recycled stock (eco-conscious choice)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Spot UV (selective glossy coating for highlights)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Custom perforations for easy opening<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Gift packaging for premium presentation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Design Setup<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Free design support and consultation available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; All board types (kraft, whiteboard, recycled)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Foil stamping (metallic shine, gold\/silver)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Custom die-cuts (unique shapes tailored to product)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Retail packaging to attract customers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Template provision and file format guidelines<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Rigid cardboard for durability<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Deboss (pressed-in design for texture)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Emboss (raised design for tactile effect)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Gift packaging to enhance unboxing experience<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Proofing and sample approval before production<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Corrugated board for heavy-duty shipping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Soft touch lamination (velvety texture)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Handles, ribbons, or magnetic closures<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Product display boxes for retail showcase<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Branding Area<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Printing available on both inside and outside surfaces<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Recycled stock with natural textures<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Lamination (protective coating, matte or gloss)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Logo windows (transparent sections for product visibility)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Product display boxes to highlight brand identity<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Large branding area for maximum visibility<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Specialty textured stocks (linen, canvas)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; UV coating for durability and shine<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Custom inserts for product protection and presentation<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Promotional packaging for events and launches<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Option for multi-color branding and spot treatments<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Kraft with white inside for contrast<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Combination finishes (e.g., matte + foil)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Security features (tamper-evident seals, holograms)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">&#8211; Subscription boxes with branded experience<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>You can choose no-print Kraft boxes or fully printed promotional boxes depending on your campaign or retail setup.<\/p>\n<h3>Coating and Add-on Features for Upgraded Appearance<\/h3>\n<p>Finishing helps protect your packaging and improve shelf impact. Available finishes:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Matte or Gloss Lamination<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV on logos<\/li>\n<li>Soft-touch for premium feel<\/li>\n<li>Scratch-resistant coating<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Handles can be punched on the top or sides based on user preference. Add flaps, windows, or tuck-in tabs as neede